others, validation of their relentless experiments. You stand in a world where there is no good nor evil, only justifications.\n\nZi\u00eaminal is a callous world with unrelenting creatures to face. It demands a unique approach if you desire any hope of survival. With the Binding System, absorb the essence of the fallen warriors you encounter throughout your journey and form a dominant party. Shape a playstyle catered to you through the skills and abilities of each warrior found, and unleash calamitous Morphstrikes through their combined powers to all who stand in your way. The Church of Death beckons. Take up arms and answer its call.", "summary": "Deathbound is a one-of-a-kind party-based soulslike set in a callous world where Faith and Science clash. The forbidden city of Akratya is an unforgiving land that cannot be conquered alone. Bind with fallen warriors found throughout your crusade and dynamically transform between characters seamlessly in mid-combat with the unique 4-hero party system.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/deathbound", "videos": [{"id": 115323, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "S3PdYobUWOk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S3PdYobUWOk", "title": "Deathbound - Official Gameplay Overview Trailer | Guerrilla Collective 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S3PdYobUWOk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 115838, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gQbyjQ7agbc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQbyjQ7agbc", "title": "Deathbound - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gQbyjQ7agbc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 122258, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "-NgKlfIreU4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-NgKlfIreU4", "title": "Deathbound - Official Steel and Magic Teaser Trailer | Realms Deep 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-NgKlfIreU4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 122259, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "xfsMm0CJY